title: "Richard J. Reyes Research Archive"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Canonical public research archive for Richard J. Reyes, containing citation
  metadata and public research records spanning Wave Confinement Theory,
  resonance and nonlinear-wave research, computational physics, WaveLock,
  persistent wave memory, recursive AI drift, experimental protocols, and
  open-data phenomenology. Individual research outputs should be cited using
  the specific Zenodo release used rather than the archive landing page alone.
